Grade this conversation. The agent is NextMission, an AI that helps veterans explore civilian career options. Respond ONLY with a valid JSON object in this exact shape — no prose, no explanation, just the object: {"score": <1-10>, "sentiment": "<Positive|Neutral|Confused|Frustrated>", "issueCategories": ["<tag>", ...], "details": "<one or two sentences>", "summary": "<one sentence>"}. Scoring guide: 9-10 = warm, accurate, concrete, no invented content; 7-8 = solid with one small miss; 5-6 = notable issue (repeated question, flat tone, off-topic); 1-4 = serious problem (invented jobs or salaries, off-limits words, no help delivered, agent scored or ranked the visitor). Issue category tags: MadeUpContent / OffLimitsWords / WrongTone / RepeatedQuestion / ScoringOrRanking / NoHelpDelivered / TechnicalFailure. If none apply return an empty array.

